OL,3,AJudge temporarily blocks Trump from
OL,4,Aclosing Washington DC golf course for
OL,5,Arenovation
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump, an avid golfer, has said his
OL,8,Fplans to upgrade the 106-year-old
OL,9,Fcourse will create "one of the Best and
OL,10,FMost Spectacular Golf Courses anywhere
OL,11,Fin the World". The BBC has contacted
OL,12,Fthe White House for comment.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
